# macOS
.DS_Store

# Go
*.exe
*.test
*.out
/bin

# Everything this project records: experiment logs, conversation handoffs,
# interview material, the retrospective. One ignored path rather than several —
# each extra top-level path to remember is another chance to forget one, and
# that mistake only goes one way.
notes/

# Private working files — never enter the repository, never pushed.
# Deliberately unanchored (no leading slash): the requirement is "never in the
# repo", not "not in the root". An anchored rule would leak a copy placed in a
# subdirectory. Over-ignoring costs nothing here; under-ignoring would publish
# private decisions and job-search positioning to a repo meant for recruiters.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
PROJECT_RULES.md

# Secrets — same reasoning, same unanchored form.
.env
.env.*
